# Copy to backend/.env and fill in. backend/.env is gitignored — never commit
# real keys, and never put any of these in the front end.

# ─── mStock ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Optional. The app normally takes the API key from the login form; this is only
# the fallback referred to in server.js.
# MSTOCK_API_KEY=

# ─── Payments ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# mock (default) = simulated purchases, no account needed, nothing charged.
# razorpay       = real Razorpay Checkout.
PAYMENT_PROVIDER=mock

# REQUIRED for razorpay. These two are all you need, including on localhost.
#
# Razorpay Dashboard → Account & Settings → API Keys → Generate Test Key.
# Make sure the dashboard is in TEST mode (the toggle at the top) — test keys
# start rzp_test_ and charge nothing.
#
# The key ID is public: the browser needs it to open Checkout. The key SECRET
# is shown ONCE on generation and must never leave this file — if it is lost,
# regenerate, which invalidates the old pair.
#
# Live keys start rzp_live_ and the backend shouts on startup when they are in
# use, because they charge real cards.
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=

# OPTIONAL, and pointless on localhost — leave it blank until this is hosted.
#
# Razorpay cannot POST to 127.0.0.1, so no webhook will ever arrive here.
# Purchases still complete: Checkout's callback is verified at
# /api/purchase/verify using an HMAC of order_id|payment_id keyed with the KEY
# secret, which only Razorpay can produce. That grants the 30 days on its own.
#
# Once hosted over HTTPS, add the webhook as well — it is the path that still
# fires when a customer closes the tab mid-payment. Dashboard → Settings →
# Webhooks → Add New Webhook; the secret is a string YOU choose there.
#
# Note these are DIFFERENT secrets signing different things:
#   key secret     signs the checkout callback  (order_id|payment_id)
#   webhook secret signs the webhook body       (the raw bytes)
#
# Subscribe the webhook to: payment.captured, payment.failed, order.paid
RAZORPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
